/* AVIS.ARTIFACT
   NAME: AVIS_SPEC
   ROLE: Root definition of the AVIS Comment Block Standard
   VERSION: 1.0
   FORMAT:
       /* AVIS.ARTIFACT
          NAME: <artifact name>
          ROLE: <artifact purpose>
          EXPORTS: <symbols>
          DEPENDS: <headers or modules>
          NOTES: <freeform>
       */
   PURPOSE:
       - Defines the canonical AVIS comment block format
       - Enables AI systems to detect AVIS blocks in the repository
       - Establishes AVIS as a structured documentation language
       - Allows Copilot to parse, index, and reference AVIS artifacts
   NOTES:
       - This file registers AVIS for the entire repository
       - All AVIS-enabled files must include an AVIS.ARTIFACT block
*/
